# Build loop operator

When continuing the LaunchReel build OR when shell output contains `AGENT_LOOP_WAKE_BUILD`:

1. Read `BUILD_BACKLOG.md` (priorities) and `docs/BUILD_LOOP.md` (process).
2. Run `npm run verify` if not already run this tick.
3. If verify fails → fix TypeScript/lint errors before new features.
4. Implement **exactly one** unchecked P0 task; mark `[x]` when done.
5. Run `npm run verify` again before finishing.
6. Never start P2 (auth/Stripe/cloud) unless the user explicitly requests it.

Prefer minimal diffs. Match existing patterns in `src/lib/` and `src/components/`.
